---
/*
  One quiet line under a speech page's hero buttons: how the data is
  collected. The NDPC registration is deliberately not here — the homepage,
  the compliance section and the footer already carry it.
*/
---

<p class="hero-trust">
  <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span>
    Data is collected only from adult contributors under written, informed consent.
    See our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </span>
</p>

<style>
  .hero-trust {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    color: #3C4A42;
    font-size: .88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .dot {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
</style>
